sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Gateway as Express Gateway
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware
    participant Validation as Validation Middleware
    participant RateLimit as Rate Limit Middleware
    participant Route as Route Handler
    participant Controller
    participant Service as Service Layer
    participant Repository
    participant Database as PostgreSQL/Redis

    Client->>Gateway: HTTP Request
    Gateway->>Auth: Authenticate Request

    alt Valid Authentication
        Auth->>Validation: Pass to Validation
        Validation->>Validation: Validate Request Body/Params

        alt Valid Request
            Validation->>RateLimit: Check Rate Limit

            alt Within Rate Limit
                RateLimit->>Route: Route Request
                Route->>Controller: Invoke Controller Method
                Controller->>Controller: Transform DTOs
                Controller->>Service: Call Service Method
                Service->>Service: Business Logic
                Service->>Repository: Data Operations
                Repository->>Database: Query/Command
                Database-->>Repository: Result
                Repository-->>Service: Data
                Service-->>Controller: Result
                Controller->>Controller: Transform to Response DTO
                Controller-->>Route: Response
                Route-->>Gateway: HTTP Response
                Gateway-->>Client: 200 OK + Data
            else Rate Limit Exceeded
                RateLimit-->>Client: 429 Too Many Requests
            end
        else Invalid Request
            Validation-->>Client: 400 Bad Request + Validation Errors
        end
    else Invalid Authentication
        Auth-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
    end

    Note over Client,Database: Error Handling
    alt Service Error
        Service-->>Controller: Throw Service Error
        Controller->>Controller: Transform to HTTP Error
        Controller-->>Gateway: Error Response
        Gateway->>Gateway: Error Handler Middleware
        Gateway-->>Client: 4xx/5xx + Error Details
    end
